---
// Conceptual artwork, not a photograph of the company or a particular product.
---
<section class="hero overflow-hidden">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site items-center gap-9 px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10 lg:py-20">
    <div>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-eyebrow font-semibold uppercase text-steel">
        <span class="dot dot--pulse"></span>IT partner za mala preduzeća
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-h1 font-bold">Računari, mreža i licence — da jednostavno rade.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[48ch] text-lead text-steel">
        IT oprema i podrška za mala preduzeća. Jedan partner, predvidiv mesečni trošak,
        bez komplikacija — u Beogradu i remote, širom Srbije.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="#kontakt" class="rounded-card bg-accent px-5 py-3.5 text-meta font-semibold text-surface transition-colors hover:bg-ink">
          Zakažite besplatan pregled
        </a>
        <a href="/shop" class="rounded-card border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-3.5 text-meta font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
          Pogledajte opremu
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[540px] overflow-hidden rounded-plan border border-line bg-paper">
      <img src="/images/it-system.webp" srcset="/images/it-system-640.webp 640w, /images/it-system.webp 1100w"
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 500px, (min-width: 600px) 540px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
        width="1100" height="1100" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
        alt="Ilustracija povezanog laptopa, monitora, mrežne opreme i uređaja za backup."
        class="block aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-line bg-surface/95 px-5 py-3 text-meta">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="dot"></span>Oprema. Podrška. Sve povezano.</span>
        <span class="hidden text-steel sm:inline">easy.rs</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
